Save to finish, then open [your dashboard]({dashboard_url}).

**Share this address:** {dashboard_url}

**Guest username:** {username}

Give the guest this link and the separate dashboard password you chose. They do not need a Home Assistant account. For access away from home, use your Home Assistant Cloud or other HTTPS remote address. Local addresses work only on your home network.

You can find this link again in the dashboard device details (Visit), or by opening Configure on this integration entry.

**Owner appearance editor:** [Edit tabs, sections, cards and colors]({editor_url}). Save this setup first, then open the editor using your HA owner account. Guest customization can stay off.

